# Only the Rust workspace goes into the API's build: its crates, this repository's spores
# (the hosts name them as optional dependencies, so even a stock build reads them), and
# a deployment's own host crate when it has spores from outside (design note 0030, §9).
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
!spores/
!.hypha-build/
# Built elsewhere and large.
.hypha-build/**/target
